{"sha": "6cd24cd06a6953cd50d7d535de521e3d7f01a7a1ca6e6a886dd89ebda3cadb52", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:transient-regimes} 章 --- 暂态：一阶与二阶}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:1}", "$\\tau = RC = 10^4 \\times 47\\times10^{-9} = \\qty{0.47}{ms}$；$u_C(\\tau)/E", "= 1 - \\eu^{-1} = 0.63$；$99\\%$：$\\eu^{-t/\\tau} = 0.01$，$t = \\tau\\ln 100", "= 4.6\\tau = \\qty{2.2}{ms}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:2}", "$\\tau = L/R = \\qty{4.0}{ms}$；$i_\\infty = E/R = \\qty{2.0}{A}$；$i(\\tau) =", "0.63 \\times 2.0 = \\qty{1.26}{A}$；在 $0^+$ 时，$i = 0$（连续性），因此", "$u_L = E - Ri = \\qty{10}{V}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:3}", "$\\omega_0 = 1/\\sqrt{LC} = \\qty{3.16e4}{rad/s}$，$f_0 = \\qty{5.03}{kHz}$；", "$Q = \\sqrt{L/C}/R = 316/100 = 3.2 > \\tfrac12$：准周期的；", "$\\tau = 2Q/\\omega_0 = \\qty{0.20}{ms}$；$\\omega = \\omega_0\\sqrt{1 - 1/4Q^2}", "= 0.987\\omega_0$，$T = \\qty{0.20}{ms}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:4}", "$R_c = 2\\sqrt{L/C} = \\qty{632}{\\ohm}$，$Q = \\tfrac12$。当 \\qty{2}{k\\ohm} 时，", "$Q = 0.16$：非周期的，缓慢衰减由较小的根", "$\\abs{r_+} \\approx \\omega_0 Q = \\qty{5e3}{s^{-1}}$ 决定（时间尺度", "\\qty{0.2}{ms}，但不振荡）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:5}", "$u = U_0\\eu^{-t/\\tau}$ 减半时，$\\eu^{-t/\\tau} = \\tfrac12$：$t_{1/2}", "= \\tau\\ln 2$。$\\tau = 3.5/0.693 = \\qty{5.05}{ms}$，$R = \\tau/C =", "\\qty{5.1}{k\\ohm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:6}", "$i = (E/R)\\eu^{-t/\\tau}$：$\\int_0^\\infty Ri^2\\,\\dd t = (E^2/R)(\\tau/2) =", "\\tfrac12 CE^2$，与 $R$ 无关。电源提供的能量为 $CE^2$：对任何电阻，效率均为", "$50\\%$。更好的办法是通过电感器充电（此时", "电流不再与电压差成正比），或分若干", "电压台阶 --- 每步 $E/n$ 仅损失 $\\tfrac12 C(E/n)^2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:7}", "$\\delta = \\ln(2.0/1.5) = 0.29$（且 $\\ln(1.5/1.12) = 0.29$：一致）；", "$Q \\approx \\pi/\\delta = 11$。$T = \\qty{0.40}{ms}$，故 $\\omega_0 \\approx", "2\\pi/T = \\qty{1.57e4}{rad/s}$（修正项 $1/8Q^2$ 约为 $0.1\\%$）。", "$L = 1/(\\omega_0^2 C) = \\qty{4.1}{mH}$；$R = \\omega_0 L/Q = \\qty{5.8}{\\ohm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:8}", "$u_C \\approx U_0\\eu^{-t/\\tau}\\cos\\omega_0 t$；$i = -C\\,\\dd u_C/\\dd t", "\\approx CU_0\\omega_0\\sin\\omega_0 t$（对 $t \\ll \\tau$），峰值为 $U_0\\sqrt{C/L}", "= 100 \\times 0.1 = \\qty{10}{A}$，在闭合后四分之一周期时达到，", "此时 $u_C = 0$：全部能量（$\\tfrac12 CU_0^2 = \\qty{50}{mJ}$）此时为磁能，", "$\\tfrac12 Li^2 = \\qty{50}{mJ}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:9}", "$\\omega_0 = \\sqrt{k/m} = \\qty{7.1}{rad/s}$，$f_0 = \\qty{1.1}{Hz}$；", "$\\alpha_c = 2\\sqrt{km} = 2\\sqrt{8\\times10^6} = \\qty{5.7e3}{N.s/m}$。", "$\\alpha = 2000$：$Q = \\sqrt{km}/\\alpha = 2828/2000 = 1.4$，准周期的；", "$T = 2\\pi/(\\omega_0\\sqrt{1 - 1/4Q^2}) = 0.89/0.935 = \\qty{0.95}{s}$；", "$\\tau = 2Q/\\omega_0 = \\qty{0.40}{s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:10}", "$i = I_0\\eu^{-t/\\tau}$，$\\tau = L/R = \\qty{5.0}{ms}$；峰值电压", "为 $RI_0 = \\qty{200}{V}$（$t = 0^+$ 时）；能量 $\\tfrac12 LI_0^2 = \\qty{1.0}{J}$", "消耗在 $R$ 中。若无此电阻，电流便无通路：", "$\\dd i/\\dd t$ 极大，线圈电压达到千伏量级，", "并在开关处产生电弧。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:11}", "从 $C$ 看去：$E_{\\mathrm{Th}} = ER_2/(R_1 + R_2) = \\qty{8.0}{V}$，", "$R_{\\mathrm{Th}} = R_1 \\parallel R_2 = \\qty{6.67}{k\\ohm}$；$\\tau =", "R_{\\mathrm{Th}}C = \\qty{6.7}{ms}$；$u_C = 8.0(1 - \\eu^{-t/\\tau})$ V。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:transient-regimes:12}", "二重根 $-\\omega_0$：$x = x_\\infty + (A + Bt)\\eu^{-\\omega_0 t}$；", "由 $x(0) = 0$ 得 $A = -x_\\infty$，由 $x'(0) = 0$ 得 $B = \\omega_0 A$：", "$x = x_\\infty[1 - (1 + \\omega_0 t)\\eu^{-\\omega_0 t}]$。$95\\%$：", "$(1 + s)\\eu^{-s} = 0.05$，$s \\approx 4.7$：$t_{95} = 4.7/\\omega_0$。对于", "$Q = 5$ 时，包络 $\\eu^{-t/\\tau}$ 中 $\\tau = 10/\\omega_0$，需要", "$3\\tau = 30/\\omega_0$；对于 $Q = 0.1$，慢根为 $\\abs{r_+} \\approx", "\\omega_0 Q$，$3/\\abs{r_+} = 30/\\omega_0$。两者都慢六倍：", "临界阻尼是无超调的最快回复方式，", "这正是仪表、闭门器或悬挂装置所需要的。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:transient-regimes:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $E = L\\,\\dd i/\\dd t + Ri + u_C$，$i = C\\,\\dd u_C/\\dd t$：", "$LC\\,u_C'' + RC\\,u_C' + u_C = E$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $u_C'' + (\\omega_0/Q)u_C' + \\omega_0^2u_C = \\omega_0^2E$，其中", "$\\omega_0 = 1/\\sqrt{LC}$，$Q = \\sqrt{L/C}/R$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\omega_0 = \\qty{3.16e4}{rad/s}$，$f_0 = \\qty{5.03}{kHz}$，", "$R_c = 2\\sqrt{L/C} = \\qty{632}{\\ohm}$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $r^2 + (\\omega_0/Q)r + \\omega_0^2 = 0$，$\\Delta = \\omega_0^2(1/Q^2", "- 4)$：$Q < \\tfrac12$ 非周期的，$Q = \\tfrac12$ 临界阻尼，$Q > \\tfrac12$", "准周期的。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $\\tau = 2Q/\\omega_0$，$\\omega = \\omega_0\\sqrt{1 - 1/4Q^2}$，", "$u_C = E + \\eu^{-t/\\tau}(A\\cos\\omega t + B\\sin\\omega t)$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $Q = 3.16$，$\\tau = \\qty{0.20}{ms}$，$T = 2\\pi/\\omega =", "\\qty{0.20}{ms}$，约三个振荡周期。", ""]}